1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,020
Long ago, two armies faced each other across a valley.

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,110
I am Goliath! Send someone out to fight me!

3
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,840
He was almost three metres tall, in bronze armour!

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,120
He's too big! No one dares!

5
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,270
Ha ha! You're all too scared!

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,950
Then David came, a young shepherd boy. He was not afraid.

7
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,520
Don't be afraid! I'll fight him!

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,930
You're just a boy. How can you win?

9
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:42,290
I kept sheep. I beat a lion and a bear!

10
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:46,880
The LORD saved me then. He'll save me now!

11
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:50,690
Too heavy! I'll go without this armour.

12
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,890
By the brook, David picked five smooth stones.

13
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,730
Little boy, you want to fight me?

14
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:06,930
You come with sword and spear. I come in the name of the LORD!

15
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:11,140
David ran forward and swung his sling!

16
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:20,230
The stone hit his forehead. Down fell the giant!

17
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:23,400
The battle belongs to the LORD!

18
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:27,700
Courage and trust in God matter more than size!
